{"parentUuid":"afb9c38c-5d3c-4c47-8fd6-5d32ad4f96d1","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgaxGYdZgyFTQrPof9wSa","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Both changes are pushed (`cac58b2`) and redeploying on Render:\n\n- **The relay on the bot service (`/gemma`).** It passes requests to Gemma on Google AI Studio with your key, which stays server-side. It only accepts the Ward site and small requests, allows 40 per visitor every 10 minutes, logs no text and stores nothing. It picks the newest Gemma your key can use.\n- **The website.** Once a check finishes, it offers \"Try the close read with Gemma\", in English and Urdu, saying plainly that this sends the chat to Ward's demo server and to use the example chat. It only appears on the demo site; the Ward app itself still reads only on the device.\n\nI'm waiting for both deploys. Then I'll confirm the relay refuses other websites and run the example chat through Gemma on the live site."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":602,"cache_read_input_tokens":929828,"output_tokens":272,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":602,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":272,"cache_read_input_tokens":929828,"cache_creation_input_tokens":602,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":602},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"7c573f25-6c60-4a02-ac14-26a7be0c7d6a","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgaxGXzctS7PxfkLHc78H","requestRef":"04d51771-b3cf-450b-acaa-2c11e605859a","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-